Date: Wed, 29 May 2024 16:51:38 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 05/53] atcspi200: supports regular & quad mode with spi-mem
 framework (#82)

Supports regular mode & quad mode with SPI memory framework.
Add CONFIG_SPI_FLASH_MX25U1635E to andes defconfig.

Reviewed-on: https://gitea.andestech.com/RD-SW/u-boot.official/pulls/82
Reviewed-by: CL Chin-Long Wang <cl634@andestech.com>
